{
  "id": "29790_suuryouka",
  "headword": "数量化",
  "reading": "すうりょうか",
  "romaji": "suuryouka",
  "part_of_speech": "noun",
  "gloss": "quantification; expressing as numbers",
  "definitions": [
    {
      "sense_number": 1,
      "gloss": "quantification; expressing in numerical terms",
      "explanation": "The act of turning something qualitative or vague into measurable numbers so it can be compared or analyzed. Often used with する as a verb, especially in research and business."
    }
  ],
  "examples": [
    {
      "id": "29790_suuryouka_ex1",
      "japanese": "{効果|こうか}を{数量化|すうりょうか}する。",
      "english": "I quantify the effect.",
      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ],
      "has_audio": false,
      "notes": null
    },
    {
      "id": "29790_suuryouka_ex2",
      "japanese": "{満足度|まんぞくど}を{数量化|すうりょうか}するのは{難|むずか}しい。",
      "english": "Quantifying satisfaction is difficult.",
      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ],
      "has_audio": false,
      "notes": null
    },
    {
      "id": "29790_suuryouka_ex3",
      "japanese": "{調査|ちょうさ}の{結果|けっか}を{数量化|すうりょうか}することで、{変化|へんか}が{比較|ひかく}しやすくなる。",
      "english": "By quantifying the survey results, changes become easier to compare.",
      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ],
      "has_audio": false,
      "notes": null
    }
  ],
  "notes": "Formed from {数量|すうりょう} (quantity) + the suffix {化|か} (-ization). Takes する to form a verb: {数量化|すうりょうか}する (to quantify).\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {数量化|すうりょうか}する: to quantify\n- {数量化|すうりょうか}が{難|むずか}しい: hard to quantify\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- {定量化|ていりょうか}: quantification — near-synonym, more common in scientific writing.\n- {数値化|すうちか}: converting into numerical values — emphasizes assigning specific figures.",
